{
 "summary": [
  "Adds diagramWarnings (new core diagram-rules): non-blocking rule checks on diff diagrams (owner module, stored data only, a relation per reference field, cross between modules, no mocks, renames as one move line), surfaced by show_diagram and the fact check.",
  "Data diagrams gain entity module (owner), indexes (DIndex) and relation cross; layout groups entities into module boxes, renders index rows and dashed cross relations.",
  "Renames become one move line: interface line from \"<module>#<old name>\" (moveSource) and field from \"<entity>.<old name>\", accepted by validateDiagram, moves, fieldNotes and completeness.",
  "Flowchart steps can link to other flowcharts (FlowNode.links), so private methods' logic is reachable; completeness and changedUnits now cover private methods with logic and a new 'index' unit kind.",
  "changedUnits counts only stored types as models (persistence tags, ORM bases/decorators), detects index changes, reads PR context lines, ignores mocks and receiver-only Go changes; mocks count as test files.",
  "Playbook and tool descriptions updated: shared CODE_CHECKS for both reviews, data-diagram and no-noise rules for plan and fact; Component boxes can be opened in full ('+N more')."
 ],
